@Blog.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7125

### ============================================
### USERS
### ============================================

### Registrar usuário
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "João",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### 0961c89a-df6e-4c6b-a578-5f57d233cfc2

### Registrar o mesmo usuário novamente
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "João",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### ============================================
### USERS - VALIDATION
### ============================================

### Cadastro inválido
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "password": "123"
}

### ============================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Login para obter os tokens
# @name login
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### Renovar os tokens
# @name refresh
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}"
}

### Reutilizar o refresh token anterior - deve falhar
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}"
}

### Login senha inválida
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao.silva@email.com",
  "password": "SenhaErrada"
}

### Login usuário inexistente
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naoexiste@email.com",
  "password": "Senha123"
}

### Login inválido
POST {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "abc",
  "password": ""
}

### ============================================
### JWT / AUTHORIZATION
### ============================================

### Meu perfil - autenticado
GET {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Meu perfil - sem token
GET {{Blog.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me